{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ForkCast 是一款把散落食譜集中管理、規劃每週餐單並整合購物清單的工具，適合經常煮食、想減少重複採購的家庭用家。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-148.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>集中管理食譜與每週餐單</h2>\n<p>ForkCast 可透過連結或 Safari 分享匯入食譜，亦可貼上烹飪影片說明並擷取材料與步驟，或建立家庭食譜及收藏集。規劃每週餐單時，可安排各日餐點、加入多日、保留剩菜、調整份數並設定晚餐提醒。所有餐單會整合成單一購物清單，自動合併相同材料用量，標記家中已有食材後剔除，並可與家庭成員分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-142-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-143-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-144-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-145-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-146-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-147-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ForkCast: Meal Plan &amp; Recipes</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/forkcast-meal-plan-recipes/id6829914322?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.136594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:18:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:26.972564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:00.958675+00:00","content_hash":"700ae8af8806315088d3f6780d6b4dc4c6eefae3472b33a66eb0357c31173bfe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.136594+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}